<title>NETHERLANDS: Aalberts 1996 net profit rises 30 pct.</title>
<headline>Aalberts 1996 net profit rises 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DRIEBERGEN, Neerlands 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.85 vs   1.48</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.45 vs   0.38</p>
<p>    Net profit			    26.2  vs  20.2</p>
<p>    Turnover			     471.0  vs 366.0</p>
<p>NOTES - Industrial components group Aalberts Industries NV said it expected a further rise in earnings per share in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
